# Build output. The image builds all of this from source in its own stages, so sending it wastes
# the upload and, worse, bakes whatever happens to be sitting in a developer's working tree into
# the image. electron-ui/release and backend-bin between them were 400 MB of desktop installers
# and self-contained binaries that the container has no use for at all.
electron-ui/release
electron-ui/backend-bin
electron-ui/dist

# Written by the image build itself, from the freshly built frontend. A copy left behind by a
# local test run would be merged into it rather than replaced, shipping stale assets.
ManagerApi/wwwroot

# Not part of the image.
AudioFileSorter.Tests
.github
images
